<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - St. Jude Medical cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - St. Jude Medical cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray said it downgraded St. Jude Medical Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- cited slower-than-expected margin improvements from acquisitions.</p>
<p>-- said the recent analysts' meeting with St. Jude indicated that little progress will be made on operating margins in 1997.</p>
<p>-- cut the 1997 earnings estimate to $1.45 a share from $1.75 a share and the 1998 estimate to $2.35 a share from $2.65 a share.</p>
<p>-- set a six-to-nine month price target of $40 a share.</p>
<p>-- St. Jude lost 1-1/4 to 34-5/8.</p>
</text>
